              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Dee T"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I made this bark recipe along with several others to give as Christmas gifts. It was very easy to make and I liked the taste of the dried cranberries and macadamias in the white bark. \n\nAfter the holidays I asked my gift recipients to rate the barks from most favorite to least favorite. This came in as the LEAST favorite. In the future I will NOT make it again for gifts, but will make it for our family.\n\nBy the way, the bark that was everyones favorite was the Oreo Cookie bark on this site.",
